          "settings": {
            "title": "Order Acceptance & Production",
            "content": "<p>When you submit an order, you are responsible for confirming the selected product, dimensions, quantity, uploaded files, delivery details, and any other order specifications. An order confirmation acknowledges receipt of your order; we may contact you if clarification or additional information is needed before fulfillment.</p><p>Orders involving custom printing are prepared using the specifications submitted at checkout or otherwise agreed with our team. We may decline or cancel orders we cannot reasonably fulfill and will communicate the available next steps.</p>"
          }
        },
        "term_02": {
          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Artwork Uploads & Customer Approval",
            "content": "<p>You are responsible for reviewing names, spelling, sizing, image placement, resolution, transparency, and colors in artwork submitted to Fineyst Transfers. Please use print-ready files and follow the file requirements shown on the relevant product or design-builder page.</p><p>Unless we explicitly confirm that an artwork proof or separate approval step is included for your order, checkout does not guarantee a manual design review or proof. If our team provides a proof, review it carefully and respond before the stated deadline. Changes may not be possible once printing or fulfillment begins.</p>"
          }
        },
        "term_03": {
          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "DTF Transfers, Gang Sheets & UV DTF Stickers",
            "content": "<p>DTF transfers are intended for compatible fabric applications using appropriate heat-press equipment and settings. UV DTF stickers are intended for suitable hard surfaces and do not use a heat press. These products are not interchangeable.</p><p>Gang-sheet customers are responsible for their chosen layout, artwork spacing, design sizes, and print-ready uploads. Fineyst Transfers will manufacture custom items based on the submitted specifications, subject to any corrections separately agreed in writing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "term_04": {
          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pricing & Payment",
            "content": "<p>Prices and available options appear on the relevant product page or at checkout. Custom-order totals may vary according to the selected dimensions, quantity, materials, and services. Applicable taxes, shipping charges, and discounts will be displayed as part of the checkout process where required.</p><p>Payment must be successfully processed before an order enters fulfillment unless a separate written arrangement applies. We may correct a clearly erroneous price before accepting an order and will notify you if it affects your purchase.</p>"
          }
        },
        "term_05": {
