          "settings": {
            "title": "Production, Shipping & Delivery",
            "content": "<p>Any production or delivery estimates displayed on our website are estimates rather than guaranteed arrival dates unless explicitly stated otherwise. Processing and transit times may be affected by artwork issues, order volume, holidays, destination, or carrier delays.</p><p>Customers must provide an accurate shipping address. If an address is incorrect or a package encounters a shipping issue, contact us promptly so we can review the available options. Please refer to our published Shipping Policy for the applicable details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "term_06": {
          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Changes, Cancellations, Returns & Refunds",
            "content": "<p>Because many Fineyst Transfers products are made to order using customer-selected specifications, requested changes or cancellations may be limited after production starts. Contact us as soon as possible if you need to modify an order.</p><p>Eligibility for returns, refunds, replacements, or remedies depends on the product, the circumstances, applicable law, and our published Refund Policy. Do not assume that all custom orders are automatically refundable or nonrefundable. If you receive an incorrect or potentially defective item, contact our team with your order number and clear photographs so we can review the issue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "term_07": {
