          "settings": {
            "title": "Application Instructions & Product Care",
            "content": "<p>Results can vary by substrate, fabric, equipment, temperature, pressure, application technique, and aftercare. Follow the instructions supplied with your product and test your settings on appropriate materials before applying to a full production run.</p><p>Fineyst Transfers cannot guarantee identical results across all fabrics, hard surfaces, heat presses, or environments. If you are unsure whether a product is suitable for your project, contact us before ordering or applying it.</p>"
          }
        },
