            "content": "<p>By submitting artwork, logos, names, or other content, you represent that you own the content or have the permissions needed to reproduce it. You grant Fineyst Transfers a limited right to use the submitted content solely to review, produce, and fulfill your order and provide related customer support.</p><p>We may refuse content that appears unlawful or infringes another party’s rights. We will not assume permission to feature your custom artwork in public marketing solely because you submitted an order.</p>"
